    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nywolirok pa Isaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owendo ri Sara paka oyido otieko waco, aka otimo ri Sara gima go oyido ociko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebu 11:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sara ogamo iye, aka onywolo ri Abraham wode i tiyo pere i hongo ma Were oyido otieko waco rigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Abraham ocwoko rigo nyinge ni Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 17:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 7:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Isaka otieko ndelo aboro, Abraham othumo go paka Were oyido omiyo go or. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abraham oyido jaoro miya acel munyo onywol Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sara owaco ni, “Were otimo ran gi kisangala gi nyero. Kisi ŋat'owinji kwoŋe bino nyeran.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Sara doko medo waco ni, “Ŋa m'oyido d'onyal waco ri Abraham ni Sara nyalo pidho nyithindho? Kucel onyo anywolo rigo wode i tiyo pere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka munyo Isaka oweyo dhoth, Abraham otimo kalima madwoŋ swa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sara miyo Abraham riemo woko Hagar gi Isimayil",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndelo acel, Sara oneno wod pa Hagar Jamisir tuko gi wode Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.4.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 4:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.4.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Sara waco ri Abraham ni, “Riemi woko ŋeca me gi wode, rupiri wod pa dhako me kiripi lunjo adec ma lim perin ma wodan ripo lunjo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gime oramo cuny Abraham rupiri Isimayil bende oyido obedo wode. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Were waco ri Abraham ni, “Ikir'irembi ri Isimayil kodi ŋeca perin Hagar, to tim gimoro je ma Sara waco rin; rupiri obedo luwo bongi Isaka, m'ibino limo nyikwayin m'atieko ciko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka abino bende miyo wod pa Hagar nyithindho, ŋey bende jowolokere nono rupiri go bende obedo wodin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abraham oay malo yawere odikin maŋic to miyo Hagar cemo gi pien m'opoŋ'iye pi, to riemo go woko. Hagar okadho to lera i thim ma Berseba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo pi orumo, oweyo wode i tiendi dudi moro ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka okidho to bedo piny kama romo mita miya acel bor gi wode. To waco ni, “Akinyali neno ka nyathi paran tho.” Munyo go fodi obedo kenyo, nyathi ocako ywak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were owinjo dwondi nyathi, aka malaika pa Were olwoŋo Hagar wok i polo to penjo go ni, “Aŋo ma ramo cunyin Hagar? Ikir'ibedi gi lworo, rupiri Were otieko winjo dwondi nyathi kama go ywak'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ay malo, itiŋ nyathi i cingin; rupiri abino loko go nono madwoŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Were oyawo waŋe aka oneno waŋ pi; okidho to poŋo pi i pien, aka omiyo nyathi to madho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were oyido nitie gi nyathi no munyo dongo, aka obedo i thim ma Paran to bedo jadwar swa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yokimere onwaŋo rigo dhako ma Jamisir.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abraham gi Abimelek jotimo cikirok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
